          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nibo bakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo, kandi oku nikwo kukuratana kw'oruzaaro rw'abaarugire naanye Babulooni omu busingye bw'omugabe Aruta-gizakiseesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 3:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.24.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "24:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omuri beene Finehaasi, Gereshoni; omuri beene Itamaari Danieli; omuri beene Daudi Hatushi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.2.3+EZR.2.4+EZR.2.5+EZR.2.6+EZR.2.7+EZR.2.8+EZR.2.9+EZR.2.10+EZR.2.11+EZR.2.12+EZR.2.13+EZR.2.14+EZR.2.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 2:3-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " omuri beene Shekania. Omuri beene Paroshi Zakaria owaahandiikirwe hamwe n'abashaija igana na makumi ataano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri beene Pahasi-moabu Eliehoenai mwene Zerahia, kandi ogwo akaba ari hamwe n'abashaija magana abiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri beene Zatu Shekania mwene Yahazieli, hamwe n'abashaija magana ashatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri beene Adini Ebedi mwene Yonasaani hamwe n'abashaija makumi ataano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri beene Elamu Yeshaya mwene Atalia hamwe n'abashaija makumi mushanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri beene Shefatia Zebadia mwene Mikaeli hamwe n'abashaija makumi munaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri beene Yoabu Obadia mwene Yehieli, hamwe n'abashaija magana abiri na ikumi na munaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri beene Baani Shelomiisi mwene Yosifia hamwe n'abashaija igana na makumi mukaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri beene Bebai Zekaria mwene Bebai hamwe n'abashaija makumi abiri na munaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri beene Azigaadi Yohanaani mwene Hakataani hamwe n'abashaija igana na ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri beene Adonikaamu abaizire bwanyima, amaziina gaabo Elifeleti, Yeueli, na Shemaaya hamwe n'abashaija makumi mukaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri beene Biguvai Usai na Zakuri hamwe n'abashaija makumi mushanju.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
