            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.7.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 7:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abo boona nkabateeranira aha mugyera Ahava, twateeraho ensiisira, twamaraho kashatu. Ku naabaire niinyetegyereza abantu n'abanyamurwa, naashanga hatarimu n'omwe ow'omuri beene Leevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naatuma kweta Eliezeeri, Arieli, Shemaya, Elinasani, Yaribu, Elinasani, Nasani, Zekaria na Meshulaamu, abashaija bakuru, hamwe na Yoyaribu na Elinasani abaabaire bari abashaija abarikwetegyereza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naabatuma ahari Ido, omutegyeki w'ekyaro ekirikwetwa Kasifia, naabagambira ebi baraagambire Ido na beene ishe abaheereza b'omuri hekalu abaabaire bari omuri ekyo kyaro, ngu batwoherereze abaheereza by'okukora omu nju ya Ruhanga waitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.7.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 7:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.6.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 6:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'omukono gwa Ruhanga waitu omurungi ogwabaire guturiho, baatureetera omushaija orikwetegyereza ow'omuri beene Mahili mwene Leevi mwijukuru wa Israeli, orikwetwa Sherebia hamwe n'abatabani na beene waabo, boona ikumi na munaana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.6.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 6:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.12.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 12:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na Hashabia hamwe na Yeshaaya ow'omuri beene Merari, na beene ishe na batabani baabo, boona makumi abiri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.2.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 2:43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.7.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " otabariireho baheereza b'omuri hekalu magana abiri na makumi abiri, abu Daudi n'abatware be baatooraine kuheereza Abaleevi. Abo boona baagambwaho nk'oku amaziina gaabo gaabaire gari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
