              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naabagira nti: Muri abeereziibwe MUKAMA, kandi ezi feeza n'ezaabu n'emitoijo ei baatoijeire MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe n'omutima gwekundiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubibiikye kandi mubirinde, okuhitsya obu muribipimira omu maisho g'abanyamurwa abakuru n'Abaleevi n'abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkuru b'Abaisraeli omu bishengye by'enju ya MUKAMA omuri Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi baayakiira efeeza n'ezaabu n'ebindi bintu, nk'oku oburemeezi bwabyo bwabaire buri, kubitwara Yerusaalemu omu nju ya Ruhanga waitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
